{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43473","headline":"秋日悬清光 · 无名氏","name":"秋日悬清光","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寥廓凉天静，晶明白日秋。\n圆光含万象，碎影人闲流。\n迥与青冥合，遥同江甸浮。\n昼阴殊衆木，斜影下危楼。\n宋玉登高怨，张衡望远愁。\n余辉如可托，云路岂悠悠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43473.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43473","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}